                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Regrading next to the foundation</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">A few hundred dollars in fill, DIY</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Soil slopes toward the wall</td>
                  </tr>
